Package: likelyprofiler
Title: Likelihood Profiles for Nonlinear Objective Functions
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Baptiste", "Turpin", , "t.baptiste0@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8853-8718"))
  )
Description: Computes profile likelihood confidence intervals with support for
    multiple optimization algorithms ('optim', 'DEoptim', custom optimizers),
    bootstrap likelihood ratio tests, and parallel computation.
